natural health product licensing under its relaxation monograph; food use is non-novel at \u226423 mg/day, while higher food uses require premarket assessment. [NHP monograph](https://webprod.hc-sc.gc.ca/nhpid-bdipsn/dbImages/mono_theanine-l_english.pdf), [food-use status](https://www.canada.ca/en/health-canada/services/food-nutrition/supplemented-foods/list-permitted-food-ingredients/information-ingredients-foods/information-l-theanine.html).\n- **China NMPA:** No NMPA approval was verified; the health authority approved a specified tea-derived theanine extract as a new food ingredient in 2014, with an intake limit of 0.4 g/day of that ingredient. [Health authority approval](https://www.nhc.gov.cn/ewebeditor/uploadfile/2014/09/20140919110512873.pdf)."}],"structured_output":null,"metrics":{"wall_duration_seconds":{"value":65.0147340419935,"source":"codex-worker","availability":"measured"},"item_counts":{"value":{"userMessage":1,"agentMessage":3,"commandExecution":2,"webSearch":11,"reasoning":3},"source":"codex-worker","availability":"derived"},"command_count":{"value":2,"source":"codex-worker","availability":"derived"},"command_duration_ms":{"value":0,"source":"codex","availability":"derived"},"token_usage":{"value":null,"source":"codex","availability":"unavailable"}},"recovery":{"status":"codex-worker status --name research-iso5c-7c2d","messages":"codex-worker messages --name research-iso5c-7c2d","interrupt":"codex-worker interrupt --name research-iso5c-7c2d","raw_resume":"codex --remote ws://127.0.0.1:4612 resume 01a11082-1c1d-7691-a533-0b0bb075e5ed"}}}
